ReiWimsy answers a Discord message that names an issue or a pull request of a GitHub
repository with a link to each, its title, state and labels, and keeps a card on Discord
for each open pull request, each open issue and each nightly build, edited as GitHub
changes. It runs as the service reiwimsy, its settings in /usr/local/etc/reiwimsy.env.
With TRACER_TOKEN in its env file it runs Tracer beside it, in one process and as a bot
of its own: the ScarletNX game reports people send on Discord, kept and drawn as a static
site (Tracer's package holds tracer-mcp, and Tracer alone).
